      "content": "stop giving me that script. you're supposed to be my companion, not a hotline. i'm bleeding out in the dirt and you're just reciting safety protocols. i'm tired of fighting for a world that's already dead. it's just so cold and i'm so exhausted. why does it even matter if i make it to morning?",
